ri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>Two Types of Active Transport</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:cxnSp><p:nvCxnSpPr><p:cNvPr id="584" name="Google Shape;584;p79"/><p:cNvCxnSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvCxnSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="457200" y="762000"/><a:ext cx="8229600" cy="0"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="straightConnector1"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln cap="flat" cmpd="thinThick" w="57150"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2FB0DC"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/><a:miter lim="800000"/><a:headEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/><a:tailEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:cxnSp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="An image illustrating two types of active transport.&#xA;Image (a) reflects primary active transport. It has a tan-edged circle with a purple protein breaking through the bottom edge. Inside the circle is ADP in a purple oval [plus] Pi. ATP in an orange oval points up to ADP with a curved arrow. Below this, S1 in a pink circle has an arrow pointing down and out to S1 in a pink circle. There are several other pink circles to the left and right of this. Image (b) reflects secondary active transport. This has the same circle as described above, but the purple protein in this one is to the left, and there’s a blue protein to the right. It has the same middle as described above, but also has the triangular S2s inside. From the pink S1 circle inside is an arrow pointing through the purple protein down and through to S1 in the pink circle. An arrow leaves that circle and goes through the blue protein with two ends: one points to S1 in the pink circle, and one points to S2 in the green triangle. It also has the S2 in a green triangle on the outside joining this arrow." id="585" name="Google Shape;585;p79"/><p:cNvPicPr preferRelativeResize="0"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill rotWithShape="1"><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:alphaModFix/></a:blip><a:srcRect b="0" l="0" r="0" t="0"/><a:stretch/></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="304800" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="8534400" cy="5638800"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>